      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "System is yet to be installed but didn't get oversell, in fact I wanted to go to bigger system but rep very concerned about potential shading issues from neighbours house.  An onsite inspection and 2 lots of satellite mapping programs left him very concerned about shading; unlike true value solar who would only quote/install from satellite maps.Zen rep very thorough but price increases put them thousands of dollars more expensive and word of mouth made me hesitate..couldn't see what the local council deal with zen was about anyway???Too many unanswered questions.The solar shop spent a good deal of time going thru best system options but he very keen on thin film panels and down on mono-crystalline panels???Will update after Mannix installs but with them no pressure,very professional.. every company had a different perspective on the same question..what a minefield; but Finn has been fantastic with links to get an unbiased overview, thank-u so much.",
